Audience buying triggers
title end

paragraph start
A trigger is the moment that turns interest into action: a result shown, a plain answer, a deadline, a recommendation from someone trusted, or a problem that suddenly gets worse.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Record triggers by where they were seen. Triggers decide where affiliate links, donation calls and product offers are placed, and every link follows the disclosure rules in the legal area.
paragraph end

